<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-30T16:06:18.086Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:06:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al Shabaab fighters are intensifying assaults on Turkish-trained Somali troops in Lower Shabelle and ambushing units near Baidoa, while the group killed a former al-Shabaab finance chief in Lower Shabelle. African Union peacekeepers are withdrawing from four bases in Lower Shabelle and Ethiopia is pulling more than 3,000 troops from Somalia, reducing external military presence. The Somali federal government has agreed to acquire Pakistani JF‑17 fighter jets and the United States has imposed entry conditions on ships calling at Somali ports. The UAE carried out its first drone strike against Al Shabaab in nearly a year and piracy off Somalia’s coast is rising, with hijacked oil tankers and hostages reported. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNSE84VGhwOGdhbkZGY1NNQXBYUURlSlRXMTF2ZWk2VmQ1MEhWTEJwTndFcFZwMUx2Uzk2cjNrN1VpMmFKU0pudkE2cEJ3cEllbkI1cHlJZG44SzdSekd2ay05NmROTzloY19LMXBBMVI1OXVLaXdzSW5lRk5IZVkzMXJ6aERNeXJTdlRJU2kwaHV0SUdfRElCRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPNzdxT0hGaF8yc29NbWhvQWJvcXEyLXNPTVMtOE9sSTNDMEYyNXNfVXowTGJaaGdSbFNtNnR3ZjBTTGt5Ry1PQnNRbHlSWG9OZFprY0p3SXhUYzlTQ05HYjYxQmk0dnA3ZjcyOFVlb0Q1azItTVFja3ZEVFdYdFhQaTQyZDYyWW5nXzktMm43Y3dDQXBvekJxc0xMMkM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQYVlrZnBEV3FySUswODk4SXhObUZFcWtKUVlya3VzbE9FcHcxVmFJSm5hX1VEMUtYc2NlSjh6M0lkVHA4NFVQY2lja2JXWkxCbjg0Sy1wZUpEa1lNRFNzb29FN0Mtb09UTUhpNnQ2LVBBME9ldXJzXzdJWlUtSHI2SVdEN0Z5anB0eXo1OEVFbUZZWVdMdDdWLXBKUWhOa1VWNlRTc3Uxcnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Horseed Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQWFR1YzRsYy11SXozZlB6eGI3MWVQSnl1